OWNERS' ASSEMBLY MINUTES
Rose Court
The ordinary owners' assembly of Rose Court was held on 18 Jan 2026 10:00 at Site toplantı salonu.
Call: the meeting was called for 18 Jan 2026 10:00; the second meeting date was given as 28 Jan 2026 10:00.
Quorum (first call): reached. Votes 6, represented 4; land share 60, represented 47.5.
According to the attendance list 3 people attended.

Agenda items and decisions
1. Açılış ve başkanlık divanı seçimi
  No decision was recorded for this item.
2. 2026 bütçesinin onaylanması
  Decision no.: 2026/1
  2026 bütçesi ve 2.000 TL aidat kabul edildi.
  Outcome: accepted
  Votes: yes 3, no 1, abstain 0
  Dissent (Zeynep Kaya): Aidat artışına karşıyım.
3. Yönetici seçimi
  Decision no.: 2026/2
  Ayşe Yılmaz bir yıl için yönetici seçildi.
  Outcome: accepted
  Votes: yes 4, no 0, abstain 0

